			"date": "2025-03-26T14:16:38.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I'm being told that too by Lighthouse but my DOM has 49,000 nodes, so I have to hold my hands up.</p><p>In reality, with content-visibility: auto on my repeated nodes, it still performs quite well, but I'll give it a trim.</p>",
