			},
			"date": "2025-03-26T15:19:51.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Hehe :-) For the amount of content that is in there, it really is not that much. It has an HTML file size that is smaller than most of the JS frameworks these days, and yet I had a lot of doubts putting a file that size.</p><p>(Tho that was with Flash and Silverlight techniques which balooned to over 1MB, if I recall correctly.)</p>",
